    "updated_at": "2024-04-02T13:56:11Z",
    "body": "Is this enough to fully close #9864? That bug mentions two issues, one of which is fixed by this PR, but the other is about synchronously running _onComplete_ which causes `load` to be delayed forever:\r\n\r\n> Additionally, calling onComplete synchronously is incorrect, as it will run the callback before the ready callbacks are setup later in [prepare the script element](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#prepare-the-script-element), causing the load event to be delayed forever.\r\n\r\nAnd I think [this is still done here](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#fetch-the-descendants-of-and-link-a-module-script:~:text=parse%20error.-,Run%20onComplete%20given%20moduleScript,-.) (though I'm not sure if this part of that bug report is valid).",
